  "title": "Coast Guard rescues 4 people from capsized vessel on Lake Erie",
  "description": "Coast Guardsmen from Air Station Detroit MH-65 Dolphin helicopter crew conducted a search and rescue mission for four people in distress due to a capsized vessel on Lake Erie near Erie, Pennsylvania, on August 8, 2025. Once on scene, the helicopter crew deployed a rescue swimmer to rescue the last remaining survivor from an air pocket beneath the vessel. (Courtesy video by Air Station Detroit)",
